OpenFang Deployment Credentials
================================

Application URL: https://{{ openfang_domain }}/
API Endpoint: https://{{ openfang_domain }}/v1/

API Authentication
==================
Bearer Token: {{ openfang_api_key }}

Docker Information
==================
Container Name: {{ openfang_container_name }}
Data Directory: {{ app_data_dir }}
Configuration File: {{ app_data_dir }}/config.toml

System Information
==================
Application User: {{ app_user }}
Application Home: {{ app_home }}
SSL Certificate: /etc/letsencrypt/live/{{ openfang_domain }}/

LLM Provider Setup
==================
To use OpenFang with LLM providers, set these environment variables:

OpenAI:
  export OPENAI_API_KEY="your-openai-key"

Anthropic:
  export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your-anthropic-key"

Groq:
  export GROQ_API_KEY="your-groq-key"

To update container environment, edit the docker run command and restart.

Channel Adapters
================
Configure optional channel adapters in {{ app_data_dir }}/config.toml:

Telegram: bot_token_env = "TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN"
Discord: bot_token_env = "DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN"
Slack: bot_token_env = "SLACK_BOT_TOKEN"

Useful Commands
===============
# Check container status
docker ps -a | grep {{ openfang_container_name }}

# View container logs
docker logs -f {{ openfang_container_name }}

# Restart OpenFang
docker restart {{ openfang_container_name }}

# Test API connection
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer {{ openfang_api_key }}" https://{{ openfang_domain }}/health

For more information, visit: https://openfang.sh/docs/
